{
  "_about": "AI builder evaluation set: ten everyday requests matching the premade types (park, plaza, botanical garden, playground, memorial, lookout hill, wetland, campground, sports park, farmstead), each on its own land, built. Compare with Show.ps1 builds of the premade types on the same land and rate each.",
